WEBVTT

00:00:04.396 --> 00:00:05.164
It was tough, huh?

00:00:05.164 --> 00:00:05.831
Yeah.

00:00:05.831 --> 00:00:06.799
Did you do the homework?

00:00:06.799 --> 00:00:07.925
Yeah.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.038
Poink!

00:00:22.181 --> 00:00:24.081
Damn you, Alexandra Hell!

00:00:25.484 --> 00:00:29.477
You've defiled Miss Miyuki!

00:00:42.935 --> 00:00:46.735
The ambush is an outdated...
Rather, an underhanded method.

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:50.634
There's no need to hold back
against someone so cowardly.

00:00:51.944 --> 00:00:54.435
No, don't! Don't!

00:00:58.017 --> 00:01:00.383
NOOO!

00:01:07.893 --> 00:01:10.863
I think it's about time. To try some.

00:01:10.863 --> 00:01:12.956
No! Stop!

00:01:36.388 --> 00:01:39.824
What... What is this?

00:01:47.266 --> 00:01:57.843
Trance, an impulse summoned by wet sin

00:01:57.843 --> 00:02:02.007
Vexed, a heartbeat made to feel flustered

00:02:03.015 --> 00:02:06.815
You ignored even the signs

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:13.021
Knowing that that logic would
become more skewed

00:02:13.425 --> 00:02:17.828
A targeted life burns

00:02:18.363 --> 00:02:23.535
A kind of pleasure, my breast hurts

00:02:23.535 --> 00:02:27.806
A grail that seems about to spill over

00:02:27.806 --> 00:02:34.313
Suppress it, hold it down till it can be controlled

00:02:34.313 --> 00:02:41.286
I've decided I want to obtain everything, O Lilith

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:43.755
I seem about to burst open, even now

00:02:43.755 --> 00:02:47.392
Hold me tight

00:02:47.392 --> 00:02:51.663
Show me the meaning behind suffering

00:02:51.663 --> 00:02:57.603
Finish it, in the end not even
a splinter of the heart

00:02:57.603 --> 00:03:02.808
Seems as if it will reach the
state of mind you seek

00:03:02.808 --> 00:03:05.410
I, I, I

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.573
I'm in spiral

00:03:08.947 --> 00:03:11.882
Qwaser of Stigmata II

00:03:12.851 --> 00:03:17.185
The Quartz Trap

00:03:20.559 --> 00:03:22.493
Well done, Miss Shiba.

00:03:23.028 --> 00:03:24.222
Mr. Oh!

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:27.495
Have some hot cocoa.

00:03:27.633 --> 00:03:29.260
Huh? But...

00:03:29.368 --> 00:03:32.860
Of course, it must be a secret
from the others, Megumi.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.405
Yes, sir.

00:03:42.314 --> 00:03:44.748
Now then, how are things progressing?

00:03:44.883 --> 00:03:46.976
Sir! It will be done soon.

00:03:47.519 --> 00:03:49.953
Your assistance has been a big help.

00:03:50.322 --> 00:03:55.453
I'm used to these algorithms,
and it serves as review for class...

00:04:15.881 --> 00:04:17.749
All set.

00:04:17.749 --> 00:04:19.876
Come on, Sasha, you too.

00:04:20.385 --> 00:04:21.420
What?

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.651
It's obvious: We wash the
panties you're wearing now.

00:04:25.424 --> 00:04:28.291
Don't be stupid! There's no way I could do that!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:31.085
You can't go getting embarrassed NOW!
Hurry and take 'em off.

00:04:31.363 --> 00:04:33.797
It's better and faster to wash everything at once.

00:04:37.869 --> 00:04:39.131
Do what you want!

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:44.705
Oh, I saw it.

00:04:46.278 --> 00:04:47.643
How unsightly.

00:04:47.746 --> 00:04:51.546
Sh-Shut up! I'm not Katja's
trained monkey like you!

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:55.087
Oh, Miss Katja! I wonder what
she's doing right now.

00:04:55.087 --> 00:04:58.523
Is she keeping herself warm?
Is she eating a proper breakfast?

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:01.960
Or maybe she's breaking in a new girl.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:02.961
Like Mafuyu.

00:05:02.961 --> 00:05:04.396
Mafuyu's not that kind of girl!

00:05:04.396 --> 00:05:05.522
Sasha!

00:05:05.797 --> 00:05:10.200
I'm going to complete this mission and
be recognized as a first-rate Maria.

00:05:10.469 --> 00:05:11.870
Just do your job.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.238
That's not for YOU to say!

00:05:13.238 --> 00:05:15.263
Ah, I knew it.

00:05:16.108 --> 00:05:18.201
It's Sasha and Hana.

00:05:19.544 --> 00:05:20.602
Tsubasa.

00:05:21.413 --> 00:05:23.438
I could hear your voices from outside.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:27.585
My, how sorry. It was loud, wasn't it?

00:05:27.919 --> 00:05:31.089
No. The two of you certainly are close.

00:05:31.089 --> 00:05:32.420
You're always together.

00:05:33.425 --> 00:05:34.593
Is that how it seems?

00:05:34.593 --> 00:05:36.686
"Unsavory ties," I guess you'd call it.

00:05:38.797 --> 00:05:42.062
Oh, that's right. You were going to do laundry.

00:05:42.301 --> 00:05:43.632
Please let us.

00:05:43.769 --> 00:05:46.829
Thank you. Ah, but I can do it my...

00:06:01.586 --> 00:06:02.654
Huh.

00:06:02.654 --> 00:06:07.353
Miss Amano, so it was your grandfather
who founded Suirei Academy.

00:06:07.759 --> 00:06:10.595
Yes, around the time when I was born.

00:06:10.595 --> 00:06:13.155
Grandpa was the first school director.

00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:17.035
That's why Mi and l...

00:06:17.035 --> 00:06:18.263
"Mi"?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.931
Uh, nothing.

00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:28.976
Say, why doesn't Sasha come join us?

00:06:29.047 --> 00:06:31.483
Huh? Oh...

00:06:31.483 --> 00:06:34.145
She's on her period today.

00:06:34.953 --> 00:06:37.080
Oh, really?

00:06:38.023 --> 00:06:39.224
Damn you, Hana!

00:06:39.224 --> 00:06:41.283
More important... ly!

00:06:42.127 --> 00:06:44.186
By "Mi," you mean Miss Seto, right?

00:06:44.529 --> 00:06:46.963
They say you've been friends since childhood.

00:06:48.066 --> 00:06:50.034
Hana! What are you?

00:06:51.002 --> 00:06:52.993
I'm just washing you.

00:06:53.205 --> 00:06:55.469
I'm good at this sort of thing.

00:06:55.674 --> 00:06:57.403
B-But...

00:06:57.576 --> 00:07:01.273
I'd like to hear MORE about you and Miss Seto.

00:07:03.515 --> 00:07:04.482
Okay...

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.355
I've been dirtied.

00:07:10.355 --> 00:07:14.724
I've been dirtied by Alexandra Hell!

00:07:15.494 --> 00:07:18.793
Ah, Miss Miyuki!

00:07:21.366 --> 00:07:23.061
Ma'am?

00:07:29.007 --> 00:07:30.269
Tsubasa.

00:07:35.113 --> 00:07:38.844
Mi and I... were always together.

00:07:40.018 --> 00:07:42.043
Like you and Sasha.

00:07:43.288 --> 00:07:44.653
Not there!

00:07:45.257 --> 00:07:46.656
Please, go on.

00:07:49.795 --> 00:07:54.562
We lost our parents around the same time,
in an accident.

00:07:55.967 --> 00:07:58.868
So we were always together, even at school.

00:08:00.605 --> 00:08:05.872
We even played together in the
VR machine that Grandpa made.

00:08:06.511 --> 00:08:09.708
That's how she and Miyuki
polished their skills, eh?

00:08:11.283 --> 00:08:15.811
Six years ago, I had an accident in virtual reality.

00:08:16.488 --> 00:08:20.584
I don't really remember what happened, but...

00:08:21.526 --> 00:08:26.395
Soon after that,
Grandpa died and I was all alone.

00:08:27.499 --> 00:08:29.831
Don't cry, Tsubasa.

00:08:30.335 --> 00:08:33.896
From now on, I'LL be the one to protect you.

00:08:35.507 --> 00:08:38.101
It's just like Mafuyu and Tomo.

00:08:39.778 --> 00:08:40.870
But...

00:08:41.179 --> 00:08:45.479
Recently, I've decided things
can't go on like this.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.049
Why not?

00:08:47.118 --> 00:08:52.852
Because it's like Mi is sacrificing
everything for my sake.

00:08:53.158 --> 00:08:56.321
At this rate, Mi's just my slave.

00:08:56.661 --> 00:08:57.863
Slave?!

00:08:57.863 --> 00:09:02.425
That's why I told Mi that I'm
okay on my own now.

00:09:04.202 --> 00:09:08.969
Even something you want more than
anything won't come true with a single word.

00:09:11.209 --> 00:09:14.804
Unless you articulate your thoughts,
your feelings will never reach her.

00:09:15.313 --> 00:09:19.249
A dear friend of mine taught me that.

00:09:20.218 --> 00:09:23.585
The same may be true for you and Miyuki, too.

00:09:24.356 --> 00:09:26.017
Sasha...

00:09:26.825 --> 00:09:28.994
That's why you should get close
to each other like this!

00:09:28.994 --> 00:09:30.086
Hana!

00:09:35.433 --> 00:09:37.560
They've gotten sensitive, just like I thought.

00:09:38.904 --> 00:09:40.064
No!

00:09:40.539 --> 00:09:42.166
Hey! What are you?

00:09:44.109 --> 00:09:47.237
Now, drink her soma.

00:09:47.579 --> 00:09:49.206
B-But...

00:09:49.581 --> 00:09:52.277
It's the best chance!

00:09:54.419 --> 00:09:55.545
Understood.

00:09:58.723 --> 00:10:00.213
Sasha?

00:10:04.729 --> 00:10:08.324
Why are you? My breasts!

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.859
I don't get it.

00:10:11.102 --> 00:10:14.833
I don't get it! Sasha... Sasha!

00:10:25.617 --> 00:10:27.175
Well, how was it?

00:10:27.619 --> 00:10:28.677
No.

00:10:28.954 --> 00:10:31.582
Tsubasa's not the Magdalene of Thunder either.

00:10:39.064 --> 00:10:43.057
Where am I? I...

00:10:43.568 --> 00:10:45.593
So you're finally awake?

00:10:47.772 --> 00:10:49.672
Mr. Oh?

00:10:51.076 --> 00:10:55.246
Um, what happened to me?

00:10:55.246 --> 00:10:56.815
And where is this?

00:10:56.815 --> 00:11:01.653
The truth is, there's one more job
I want you to help me with.

00:11:01.653 --> 00:11:02.779
Huh?

00:11:09.928 --> 00:11:12.055
What? What's this?

00:11:15.767 --> 00:11:19.134
I will have you become one of these girls.

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:20.635
N-No!

00:11:23.274 --> 00:11:25.606
As I thought, quite delicious.

00:11:43.862 --> 00:11:47.161
Soon, the Magdalene of Thunder shall awaken.

00:11:58.977 --> 00:12:02.777
Huh? When did I fall asleep?

00:12:06.685 --> 00:12:08.516
Megumi?

00:12:11.322 --> 00:12:16.961
Everyone shown here is assisting me
with a plan overseen by this school,

00:12:16.961 --> 00:12:19.623
a project to develop a new computer system.

00:12:20.165 --> 00:12:23.935
They'll be absent for a while,
until the project is completed.

00:12:23.935 --> 00:12:25.596
Please don't worry.

00:12:26.004 --> 00:12:27.528
Oh, so that's it?

00:12:28.039 --> 00:12:32.373
Having the students help your research...
What a selfish sponsor.

00:13:08.613 --> 00:13:10.882
I-I won't lose.

00:13:10.882 --> 00:13:13.043
I, Ayame, won't lose!

00:13:28.066 --> 00:13:29.499
Mi...

00:13:30.034 --> 00:13:31.194
Miss Amano.

00:13:32.537 --> 00:13:33.697
Mr. Oh.

00:13:33.772 --> 00:13:35.330
Do you have a moment?

00:13:35.807 --> 00:13:39.106
There's something that I must discuss with you.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:46.479
The truth is, I formerly worked
alongside Director Amano.

00:13:47.252 --> 00:13:51.621
Back then, he asked me
personally to look after you.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.517
Oh, really?

00:14:03.968 --> 00:14:05.637
What's this?

00:14:05.637 --> 00:14:11.576
It's what your grandfather, Haruyuki Amano, was
working on: a new generation of supercomputer.

00:14:12.143 --> 00:14:14.077
My grandfather made this?

00:14:14.445 --> 00:14:19.405
Tsubasa, do you recall having ever heard
of the "Magdalene of Thunder"?

00:14:19.818 --> 00:14:22.309
Magdalene of Thunder? No.

00:14:22.787 --> 00:14:24.956
I see.

00:14:24.956 --> 00:14:28.414
Then surely, your memories have been erased.

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:29.594
Huh?

00:14:29.594 --> 00:14:32.256
I will tell you, Tsubasa Amano.

00:14:32.831 --> 00:14:37.996
The Magdalene of Thunder is the ability to
manipulate all electrical information at will.

00:14:39.637 --> 00:14:42.435
I shall receive that power.

00:15:01.826 --> 00:15:04.362
Even Tsubasa, the suspicious one,
was a dead end.

00:15:04.362 --> 00:15:07.354
Just where is the Magdalene of Thunder?

00:15:08.032 --> 00:15:11.126
We may have overlooked something.

00:15:11.502 --> 00:15:15.165
If we take too long, Athos is gonna get impatient.

00:15:15.406 --> 00:15:20.311
Yes. There's no guarantee the top members
won't resort to forceful measures.

00:15:20.311 --> 00:15:21.412
Huh?

00:15:21.412 --> 00:15:24.716
We search the school again, from top to bottom!

00:15:24.716 --> 00:15:26.809
Hey, wait!

00:15:29.587 --> 00:15:30.986
I did it!

00:15:33.157 --> 00:15:33.892
Huh?

00:15:33.892 --> 00:15:35.593
You just don't learn.

00:15:35.593 --> 00:15:37.185
No way!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:39.990
NO!

00:15:45.336 --> 00:15:47.236
I could get used to this...

00:15:49.173 --> 00:15:50.970
I've gotten tired of this taste.

00:15:51.509 --> 00:15:54.273
Hey, get me down from here already.

00:15:54.812 --> 00:15:55.904
You fool.

00:16:00.752 --> 00:16:02.686
Huh? What?!

00:16:08.393 --> 00:16:11.260
That's a diamond monofilament!

00:16:20.405 --> 00:16:21.838
Bastard.

00:16:23.041 --> 00:16:27.102
How dare... How dare you
make a mockery of me?!

00:16:27.545 --> 00:16:30.412
A man's! A MAN'S breast!

00:16:30.648 --> 00:16:33.116
You made me suck such a filthy thing!

00:16:33.818 --> 00:16:36.446
Tough shit! You're the one who
sucked without permission!

00:16:36.955 --> 00:16:43.918
Once I cut that thing off you,
you'll go from a man to a woman.

00:16:44.195 --> 00:16:45.719
Let me cut it off!

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.062
I refuse!

00:16:47.398 --> 00:16:48.592
Then die!

00:16:49.133 --> 00:16:56.096
In life, I face death.
Earth to earth, ashes to ashes, dust to dust.

00:16:56.541 --> 00:16:59.908
In the name of my Master, return to dust!

00:17:02.814 --> 00:17:04.441
A Qwaser of carbon.

00:17:04.615 --> 00:17:05.639
An Adept, eh?

00:17:08.519 --> 00:17:10.646
I've met you once before.

00:17:10.888 --> 00:17:12.446
I don't know you, bastard.

00:17:13.491 --> 00:17:15.425
You have a bad memory.

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:18.151
That power... Alexandra Hell!

00:17:18.629 --> 00:17:20.961
Bastard, you're a Qwaser of iron?!

00:17:21.699 --> 00:17:23.394
It's not Alexandra...

00:17:23.634 --> 00:17:24.896
It's Alexander!

00:17:30.975 --> 00:17:33.443
Impossible? Carbon losing to iron?

00:17:33.778 --> 00:17:35.075
Make no mistake.

00:17:35.213 --> 00:17:36.908
It's not a difference in the elements...

00:17:37.315 --> 00:17:39.408
It's the difference of our power levels!

00:17:39.951 --> 00:17:42.920
Tremble! Kneel in fear!

00:17:50.995 --> 00:17:51.962
A glass arm?

00:17:57.301 --> 00:17:58.495
A silicate user?

00:17:58.736 --> 00:18:04.106
Never did I think that a Qwaser of Athos
had disguised himself as a woman.

00:18:04.242 --> 00:18:09.509
Bastard, you're Ground Zero, one of the
Adepts' 12 Disciples. Real name...

00:18:10.014 --> 00:18:11.140
Wang-Chen.

00:18:13.017 --> 00:18:14.507
How unsightly.

00:18:16.187 --> 00:18:18.314
You're after the Magdalene of Thunder?

00:18:18.523 --> 00:18:20.821
There's no need to say as such now.

00:18:21.192 --> 00:18:23.160
Something like THIS won't stop me.

00:18:23.528 --> 00:18:24.756
In that case...

00:18:38.943 --> 00:18:42.713
Silicate mixed with carbon,
in other words, carbon silicate.

00:18:42.713 --> 00:18:45.238
Its hardness approaches that of diamonds!

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:58.255
You've improved, boy.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.591
I won't lose to some silicate user!

00:19:04.936 --> 00:19:06.369
Is that so?

00:19:06.571 --> 00:19:07.503
Now then...

00:19:08.372 --> 00:19:09.270
What's that?!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:15.636
I have given material form to the virtual reality
created by Suirei Academy's quantum computer.

00:19:16.581 --> 00:19:18.776
It can't be. That's impossible!

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.785
It IS possible.

00:19:20.785 --> 00:19:23.310
The Magdalene of Thunder,
which lay hidden in this school...

00:19:24.122 --> 00:19:26.113
is already in my hands!

00:19:39.837 --> 00:19:41.065
Eat this!

00:19:48.746 --> 00:19:52.204
Now then... You will die, Qwaser of iron.

00:19:54.952 --> 00:19:55.941
< Fire! >

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.080
What's this?

00:20:09.066 --> 00:20:12.627
You've been dragging your feet,
so they sent ME out here as well.

00:20:15.106 --> 00:20:16.300
Katja.

00:20:16.474 --> 00:20:18.476
That suits you, Zelezo.

00:20:18.476 --> 00:20:22.572
What sort of face would Mafuyu make
if she knew THIS was your hobby?

00:20:27.952 --> 00:20:31.556
M-M-M-M-M-M-M-M-Miss Katja!

00:20:31.556 --> 00:20:33.391
Oh. You're here too, Hana?

00:20:33.391 --> 00:20:35.086
How cruel.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:40.220
Woman... You're the Qwaser of copper,
Ekaterina Kurae?

00:20:40.965 --> 00:20:43.331
You're rather haughty for someone so lowly.

00:20:43.634 --> 00:20:45.534
So it's two against two...

00:20:46.904 --> 00:20:49.031
No, two against one?

00:20:50.174 --> 00:20:52.574
I must postpone this battle.

00:20:54.345 --> 00:20:55.334
Hey, wait!

00:20:57.548 --> 00:20:59.846
Nothing but bravado. How tacky.

00:20:59.917 --> 00:21:02.818
I shall add you to the Magdalene's slaves.

00:21:03.888 --> 00:21:04.980
Look out!

00:21:08.159 --> 00:21:10.491
Miss... Katja.

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:13.856
Hana.

00:21:21.239 --> 00:21:25.039
Wait... What's going on here?!

00:21:48.399 --> 00:21:54.805
Unstable, an asymmetrical trajectory

00:21:54.805 --> 00:22:01.312
Irises shaded in prelude

00:22:01.312 --> 00:22:07.585
The light's terminal line remains distorted

00:22:07.585 --> 00:22:13.148
And deceives the visualized dream

00:22:15.059 --> 00:22:20.431
In that dark, fictional abyss

00:22:20.431 --> 00:22:26.504
Someday, smash through the imprisoned world

00:22:26.504 --> 00:22:28.472
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.472 --> 00:22:30.141
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.141 --> 00:22:33.344
Slice the cross, is the voice that recites

00:22:33.344 --> 00:22:36.981
A poem of awakening to an absent god

00:22:36.981 --> 00:22:39.817
The blade of sacrilege?

00:22:39.817 --> 00:22:41.419
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.419 --> 00:22:43.054
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.054 --> 00:22:46.824
An oratorio with you, who have been cut off

00:22:46.824 --> 00:22:49.694
Sorrow is illuminated by the moon

00:22:49.694 --> 00:22:55.291
An eve that leads to a sparkling blue tomorrow

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:11.115
Next Episode

00:23:11.115 --> 00:23:13.217
Next Episode
Everyone in front of your TVs, it's been a while.

00:23:13.217 --> 00:23:14.618
I'm Ekaterina Kurae.

00:23:14.618 --> 00:23:17.321
M-M-M-Miss Katja! At last... At last!

00:23:17.321 --> 00:23:20.324
Huh? Who are you again? Hina? Funa? Hena?

00:23:20.324 --> 00:23:22.993
